OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright but mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy day. Cloud will thicken from
OL,7,Fthe west as outbreaks of rain spread
OL,8,Feastward on a freshening breeze by the
OL,9,Fend of the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,12,Fmoving eastwards followed by showers
OL,13,Fin the evening, the showers will
OL,14,Fgradually ease by the morning.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FA cloudy start with isolated
OL,17,Fshowers, then a mostly dry day with
OL,18,Fthe odd coastal shower possible.
OL,19,FFeeling warm in the light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
